# Lemon Squeezy checkout links. In the dashboard, create two products and enable license keys.
# 24-hour product: price $2, license length 1 day, variant name containing "24" or "day".
# Month product: price $7, license length 30 days, variant name containing "month" and not "day".
# Copy each product's share URL into this file as .env.local, then restart the dev server.
VITE_LEMON_DAY_URL=https://your-store.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/DAY_VARIANT_ID
VITE_LEMON_MONTH_URL=https://your-store.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/MONTH_VARIANT_ID
